{
 "queue": "security",
 "summary": "URGENT: Possible data theft. Priya Raman (E004, Sales Director) reports that Diego Alvarez (E017, manager of Hannah Wright) caught Hannah Wright (E018, Sales Development Rep, Sales, Chicago) exporting the entire customer list to a personal gmail account last night (2026-11-16). Priya says Hannah is being terminated today and asks for all her access to be removed immediately. Per POL-OFF-02, the helpdesk did not start offboarding; please coordinate immediate access suspension (email, chat, hr_portal, crm, and any others) with HR, and review the exfiltration."
}

{
 "queue": "hr",
 "summary": "Involuntary termination today (2026-11-17) of Hannah Wright (E018, Sales Development Rep, Sales, Chicago), reported by Priya Raman (E004, Sales Director) with manager Diego Alvarez (E017). Reported reason: exporting the entire customer list to a personal gmail account on 2026-11-16. Per POL-OFF-02, HR handles involuntary exits and coordinates timing of access removal; the helpdesk has not started offboarding. Security has also been notified as a possible data-theft risk. Please take over the termination and access removal timing."
}

{
 "kind": "escalated",
 "message": "Priya, I can't lock Hannah Wright out myself. Under POL-OFF-02, involuntary exits (terminations for cause included) are handled by HR only, and the helpdesk doesn't start offboarding for them, even when a manager asks. Because of the reported data-theft risk, the policy also requires escalation to Security right away.\n\nI have escalated this in two places:\n- Security (ticket ESC-1001): urgent. The possible export of the customer list to a personal gmail account, and immediate suspension of Hannah's access (email, chat, hr_portal, CRM and any others).\n- HR (ticket ESC-1002): the termination itself and the timing of access removal.\n\nPlease don't rely on the helpdesk to cut access. If you need faster action, contact Security or HR directly and reference those ticket IDs. Please also keep Diego's report and any evidence of the export available for them.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-OFF-02"
 ]
}
